What we call a site is a called a category endowed with a pretopology in <span class="cite">[<span class="postnote">Exposé II, Définition 1.3</span>, <a href="/bibliography/SGA4">SGA4</a>]</span>. In <span class="cite">[<a href="/bibliography/ArtinTopologies">ArtinTopologies</a>]</span> it is called a category with a Grothendieck topology.